just showing off my notes because I put a lot of effort in it What's this?! Oh, this is my pencil case It's very big, yeah~ This is my journal It has a lot of my stuff inside These are all my doodles I really like to doodle in my free time It helps me to focus So yes! Ok what else A pouch Wet tissue Ear phones Keys And this - I swear this - oh my god! They're clean, I swear, I swear It just fell off my make up bag Ok, to divert the topic Where's my phone though? Let's see my recently added (songs) I was at Star Awards final show So when Hero won, my drama We won Best Drama (Award) So I went up, so I placed my phone at the side And then I just went up So when I came back James Seah, he was like - he held it like that Eh Ying, is this your phone? I found it on the floor So I came back, I looked at it, I was like, \"Which loser has such a banged up phone and still use it?\" So I was like, \"No?\" I looked at him, I was damn proud about it, I was like \"No?\" And he said, \"Oh, ok, I found it on the floor\" I was like yeah, whatever Then I went back to my seat and I realized that My phone was missing! So I walked back to James in shame I was like, \"Can I look at that phone?\" And I was like, oh, that's my phone I was like, what happened to it? Then I realized, it's because When I left, the phone slipped off the arm rest And you know in Mediacorp's theatre The chair flips up So, so it just happened So! The latest music is Clean Bandits' Symphony And Stay, by Zedd and Alessia That's all, thank you very much! Thank you! Time to keep all my stuff, byebye! Hey hey If you like me Click here! If you want to subscribe me Click there! Ok?",
